detailedExplanation.whatItIs:
A pseudo-element targets a portion of an element rather than the whole element. ::before and ::after insert generated content; ::first-line and ::first-letter style parts of text; ::selection styles highlighted text. Example:
.tag::before {
  content: '#';
}

A transition interpolates a property between its old and new value when that value changes, configured with the transition property. An animation uses @keyframes to define a sequence of states and the animation property to play it. Example:
.btn { transition: background 0.3s; }
@keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
